<title>USA: Centra Capital unit sees revs at $3.0 mln.</title>
<headline>Centra Capital unit sees revs at $3.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centra Capital Corp unit Technology Logistics Systems on Wednesday said its revenues are growing at a rate that should approach $3.0 million for 1997, which is double the $1.5 million achieved in 1996.</p>
<p>In a statement, Centra said its unit has expanded its account base and diversified its business.  In addition, the company is also seeking acquisitions.</p>
